## Usage Examples

### Running the Python Sidecar Directly
```bash
python3 sidecar_engine.py
# Then test with: curl http://localhost:8765/api/health
```

### Using in Tauri Application
1. Add dependencies to `Cargo.toml`:
```toml
[dependencies]
reqwest = { version = "0.11", features = ["blocking", "json"] }
serde = { version = "1.0", features = ["derive"] }
rand = "0.8"
nix = "0.24"
ctrlc = "3.2"
```

### Using in Node.js Application
```bash
npm install axios
node client.js
```

